heading h2 "Plan"
para "I'll fix the failing test in ui/richtext.go first, then check the rest."
	"failing test" style=2
	"ui/richtext.go" style=4
	"check" style=1
item depth=1 #1 "Read the test"
item depth=1 #2 "Patch layout():"
	"layout()" style=4
item depth=2 "keep the cache"
item depth=2 "drop the old path"
	"the old path" style=8
item depth=1 #3 "Run go test ./ui/..."
	"go test ./ui/..." style=4
para open "See https://github.com/yuin/goldmark and the guide."
	"https://github.com/yuin/goldmark" style=16 link="https://github.com/yuin/goldmark"
	"the guide" style=16 link="docs/guide/richtext.md"
